      <title>中国研究人员发现新型蜱传病毒：与发热性疾病有关 合并感染或加重病情</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E4%BA%BA%E5%91%98%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%96%B0%E5%9E%8B%E8%9C%B1%E4%BC%A0%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%83%AD%E6%80%A7%E7%96%BE%E7%97%85%E6%9C%89%E5%85%B3-%E5%90%88%E5%B9%B6%E6%84%9F%E6%9F%93%E6%88%96%E5%8A%A0%E9%87%8D%E7%97%85%E6%83%85/</link>
